X:1
T: I Sing the Mighty Power of God
C: Words: Isaac Watts, 1709.
C: Music: 'Ellacombe' from Gesangbuch der Herzogl. Hofkapelle, Wurttemberg, 1784. Setting: "Amore Dei", 1897.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2014 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: Hymnal "Amore Dei" (published 1897)  Hymn 115.  ABC file contributed to the Open Hymnal by Tobin Strong, 09 Jan 2014.
M: 4/4
L: 1/4
