w: 1.~I sing the * migh- ty pow'r of God, That made * the moun- tains rise;
w: 2.~I sing the * good- ness of the Lord, That filled * the earth with food:
w: 3.~There's not a * plant or flow'r be- low, But makes * Thy glo- ries known;
